{"lines": ["Two Chicago TV stations were hijacked in one night, by a man in a Max Headroom mask.", "Sunday, November twenty-second, nineteen eighty-seven. At fourteen past nine, WGN's sports report cuts to black.", "A swaying figure in a mask and sunglasses appears, with only a grinding buzz for sound.", "But engineers retune one link, and in thirty seconds he's gone. Two hours later, he's back.", "At eleven-twenty, WTTW is taken, in the middle of Doctor Who. This time there's sound. He rants for ninety seconds.", "At the Sears Tower transmitter, nobody is on duty.", "Experts say someone beamed a stronger microwave signal at both towers.", "The FCC finds no one. Nobody has ever claimed it. Was it a disgruntled insider, or a hacker who could hijack two Chicago TV stations?"], "words": [["Two", 0.0, 0.14], ["Chicago", 0.14, 0.58], ["TV", 0.58, 1.08], ["stations", 1.08, 1.52], ["were", 1.52, 2.24], ["hijacked", 2.24, 2.58], ["in", 2.58, 3.0], ["one", 3.0, 3.16], ["night,", 3.16, 3.48], ["by", 3.48, 4.12], ["a", 4.12, 4.26], ["man", 4.26, 4.56], ["in", 4.56, 4.82], ["a", 4.82, 4.9], ["Max", 4.9, 5.16], ["Headroom", 5.16, 5.68], ["mask.", 5.68, 5.96], ["Sunday,", 6.32, 6.682], ["November", 6.862, 7.122], ["twenty-second,", 7.122, 7.873], ["nineteen", 7.873, 8.374], ["eighty-seven.", 8.374, 9.062], ["At", 9.422, 9.622], ["fourteen", 9.622, 9.922], ["past", 9.922, 10.462], ["nine,", 10.462, 10.902], ["WGN's", 11.162, 12.202], ["sports", 12.202, 12.462], ["report", 12.462, 12.962], ["cuts", 12.962, 13.342], ["to", 13.342, 13.702], ["black.", 13.702, 13.962], ["A", 14.322, 14.375], ["swaying", 14.375, 14.795], ["figure", 14.795, 15.015], ["in", 15.015, 15.335], ["a", 15.335, 15.415], ["mask", 15.415, 15.735], ["and", 15.735, 15.995], ["sunglasses", 15.995, 16.455], ["appears,", 16.455, 17.035], ["with", 17.295, 17.455], ["only", 17.455, 17.715], ["a", 17.715, 17.875], ["grinding", 17.875, 18.295], ["buzz", 18.295, 18.675], ["for", 18.675, 19.035], ["sound.", 19.035, 19.295],